        qudt:hasDimensionVector    qkdv:A0E0L2I0M1H0T0D0;
        qudt:plainTextDescription  "\n  The quantity kind 'Product of Inertia in the Y axis' is a measure of a body's \n  dynamic (or coupled) imbalance resulting in a precession when rotating about an axis\n  other than the body's principal axis.\n  ";
        skos:broader               quantitykind:PRODUCT-OF-INERTIA .

