        dcterms:description         "\"Mass Fraction of Water\" is one of a number of $\\textit{Concentration}$ quantities defined by ISO 80000."^^qudt:LatexString;
        qudt:hasDimensionVector     qkdv:A0E0L0I0M0H0T0D1;
