        qudt:latexDefinition        "\"Celsius Temperature\", the thermodynamic temperature $T_0$, is exactly $0.01$kelvin below the thermodynamic temperature of the triple point of water.\n$t = T - T_0$, where $T$ is Thermodynamic Temperature and $T_0 = 273.15 K$."^^qudt:LatexString;
        qudt:plainTextDescription   "\"Celsius Temperature\", the thermodynamic temperature T_0, is exactly 0.01 kelvin below the thermodynamic temperature of the triple point of water.";
