        dcterms:description          "\n  The unit $\\textit{Atmosphere Cubic Metre per Mole}$ consists of the power of the SI base unit metre with the exponent 3 multiplied by the unit atmosphere divided by the SI base unit mol.\n  "^^qudt:LatexString;
