        dcterms:description          "$\\textit{Ampere Hour per Cubic Decimetre}$ is the product of the SI base unit ampere\n and the unit hour divided by 0.001-fold of the power of the SI base unit metre with\n  the exponent 3.\n "^^qudt:LatexString;
